  {
   "t": "cardFlip",
   "in": "dolly",
   "pillar": "eat",
   "say": "It's one researcher's *theory*, and it's still debated. But if he's right, the way your ancestors cut their dinner is still written in your *face*.",
   "p": {
    "frontLabel": "A THEORY",
    "heard": "Cutlery changed our bite.",
    "backLabel": "IF HE'S RIGHT",
    "actual": "Your ancestors' dinners are written in your face.",
    "source": "C. L. Brace (1977), via Bee Wilson",
    "flipOn": "if"
